                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Cantilever with two loads / FULL-SOLID FEM
Default: two simultaneous forces, not separate load cases; points (6,6) and (12,6).
Example units: mm, N; E=210000 N/mm2, nu=0.3, thickness=2 mm. Each load: (0,-1,0) N.
Illustrative data: use your actual material and loads. No automatic yield check.</item>
